📋 *AI Settings*

🤖 AI: {{enabled}}
   Turns the AI on/off for this chat. When off, it won't respond to anything — not even a command or mention.
   _!{{cmd}} on / off_

👂 Passive intervention: {{intervention}}
   Lets the AI jump into the conversation on its own (without being called) when it notices an unanswered question or a clear help request. When off, it only replies when directly triggered.
   _!{{cmd}} intervention on / off_

🎨 Stickers: {{sticker}}
   Allows the AI to send one of its own stickers as a reaction, only in light, casual moments. When off, it never sends stickers, only text.
   _!{{cmd}} sticker on / off_

🧠 Thinking before answering: {{thinking}}
   Shows the "Thinking..." bubble while the AI works out its reply. When off, it answers directly, without that visible step.
   _!{{cmd}} thinking on / off_

🔧 Show tool usage: {{tools}}
   Shows progress notices ("searching...", "reading file...") while the AI uses a tool. When off, tools run in the background, no notice.
